## Thirdweb responsibilities

| Feature | Use |
|---------|-----|
| In-app wallet (phone / email / social / passkey) | Default login; silent signing after UI confirm |
| Smart account + `sponsorGas: true` | No CELO required for gas; no gas popups |
| `sendTransaction` in browser | User-signed Mento swap + transfer or vault deposit |
| Phone auth | Claim-page verification against `phoneHash` |
| Session keys (optional Phase 3) | Limited Telegram automation without full key custody |

**Env:** `NEXT_PUBLIC_THIRDWEB_CLIENT_ID` (web). Agent never sees user private keys.

**API change:** `POST /api/transfer/prepare` returns unsigned tx calldata + Mento route; web signs via Thirdweb and calls `POST /api/transfer/confirm` with `txHash`. Replace today's `POST /api/transfer` (agent signs everything).

