## Signing model migration

| Phase | Sender signs | Recipient |
|-------|--------------|-----------|
| **Now** | Agent (`AGENT_PRIVATE_KEY`) | Wallet or escrow from agent deposit |
| **Phase 1** | User (Thirdweb) for wallet sends | Unchanged |
| **Phase 2** | User deposits to vault for phone recipients | Claim via link + Thirdweb + phone verify |
| **Phase 3** | Deprecate agent-funded sends except gas sponsorship / demos | Full phone-first remittance |

Keep `AGENT_PRIVATE_KEY` only for: server health checks, MCP demos, scheduled jobs that users explicitly authorize, or subsidized gas — not routine user sends.

