## Success criteria

- [ ] No production user send is signed by `AGENT_PRIVATE_KEY`.
- [ ] *“Send to {name}”* works when contact has phone but no wallet.
- [ ] Recipient can claim only with link + matching phone.
- [ ] Contacts and history are isolated per user across web and Telegram.
- [ ] Web app exposes a clear path to the Telegram agent.
- [ ] New Telegram user with no account can reach first send via bot-guided wallet + deposit links.

